Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.05,0:00:05.04,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Yor's other identity...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.57,0:00:06.83,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Thorn Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.83,0:00:09.77,main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,You will be providing \Nprotection on this mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.77,0:00:12.60,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Yor ended up on a luxury \Ncruise to help a member
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.60,0:00:15.11,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,of the mafia defect while \Nacting as her bodyguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.11,0:00:16.21,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Meanwhile...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.21,0:00:17.79,main,Employee B,0,0,0,,We have a winner!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.23,0:00:20.93,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Anya won first place in a raffle,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.93,0:00:25.11,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,and the Forgers just happened to \Nend up on the same cruise ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.71,0:00:30.50,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Many assassins had already snuck aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.92,0:00:34.68,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Sickle-and-Chain Barnaby?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.93,0:00:39.46,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,What should I do? This is going \Nto turn into a commotion!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.46,0:00:42.34,main,Anya,0,0,0,,The lady from the circus is so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.77,0:00:44.39,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Nice, Miss Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.39,0:00:48.29,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Anya did her best to make sure Loid \Ndidn't find out Yor's true identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.29,0:00:53.60,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Hero Anya cannot contain her excitement \Nfrom this epic adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.89,0:00:55.14,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Could you be any lamer?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.94,0:00:58.78,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Yor continued to evade the enemy's attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.09,0:01:01.27,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,What am I doing this for?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.85,0:01:04.63,italics,Glasses,0,0,0,,I've found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.83,0:01:06.71,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,While the fireworks show was happening,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.71,0:01:10.00,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Yor and the other assassins \Nwere fighting to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.00,0:01:14.37,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I just wanted to protect his simple life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.76,0:01:16.57,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Things are not going to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.57,0:01:18.80,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,No... Now more than ever...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.14,0:01:21.52,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm sure Loid will acknowledge me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.92,0:01:23.31,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,He'll forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.04,0:01:26.64,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I will not give up...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.56,0:01:28.82,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,this fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.49,0:03:04.99,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,sign,0,0,0,,{\fscx34\pos(448,280)\fad(524,1)}The Hand That Connects to the Future
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.25,0:03:23.56,main,Anya,0,0,0,,The fireworks were so pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.56,0:03:28.58,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm glad you enjoyed them. \NBut I'm sorry we couldn't find Yor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.58,0:03:30.43,main,Loid,0,0,0,,This ship is just too big.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.43,0:03:31.48,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.65,0:03:35.27,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I'd totally forgotten about Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.60,0:03:37.33,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I need to find her, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.05,0:03:44.42,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,The State Security Service \Nofficers seem uneasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.42,0:03:45.61,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.29,0:03:48.94,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,"Gather personnel quickly..."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.94,0:03:51.49,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,"...has been set in a room..."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.02,0:03:53.63,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,A bomb at the bottom of the ship?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.94,0:03:55.45,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Say what now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.85,0:03:58.61,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,But who set it? And why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.61,0:04:01.22,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,What should I do? Gather more information?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.22,0:04:04.51,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,No... The State Security Service \Nofficers will take care of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.51,0:04:06.97,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,There'll definitely be risks \Nif I stick my neck out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.56,0:04:10.01,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,But the unthinkable could happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.01,0:04:13.47,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Considering the greater risk at hand, \NI can't just avoid this, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.27,0:04:15.99,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,But I also can't leave Anya alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.99,0:04:16.93,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.93,0:04:17.99,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.22,0:04:20.84,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya's not done playing yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.84,0:04:21.79,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.79,0:04:23.61,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Seriously? Right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.61,0:04:27.50,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya's gonna go play in there. \NYou go back to our room!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.45,0:04:31.25,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,A daycare center? Perfect timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.25,0:04:35.84,main,Loid,0,0,0,,All right. I'll come get you in a bit, \Nthen. Just stay right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.84,0:04:36.74,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Okee.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.45,0:04:39.49,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Please take good care of my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.99,0:04:41.48,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Her name is Anya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.48,0:04:42.81,main,Lady,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.81,0:04:45.38,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Wow, I get to play with a ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.03,0:04:49.34,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Okay, now's my chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.34,0:04:50.40,main,Lady,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.40,0:04:52.88,main,Lady,0,0,0,,What should we play with, Anya?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.88,0:04:55.52,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya is playing with this ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.52,0:04:57.91,main,Lady,0,0,0,,Yes, you sure are. You're amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.91,0:04:59.67,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Gonna be bored with it soon, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.39,0:05:01.44,main,Anya,0,0,0,,And I'm bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.44,0:05:03.92,main,Lady,0,0,0,,Right... I guess that's enough of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.92,0:05:05.88,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya's gonna draw now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.88,0:05:06.90,main,Lady,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.12,0:05:08.22,main,Lady,0,0,0,,Just one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.82,0:05:11.91,main,Lady,0,0,0,,Okay, what should we draw?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.59,0:05:14.42,main,Lady,0,0,0,,Er... huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.67,0:05:16.09,main,Lady,0,0,0,,Anya?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.05,0:05:29.18,main,State Security Service Officer B,0,0,0,,Well? Can you disarm it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.18,0:05:31.40,main,State Security Service Officer A,0,0,0,,Shut up. I'm trying to concentrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.40,0:05:34.51,main,State Security Service Officer C,0,0,0,,We're counting on you. There are some \Nreally important people on this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.51,0:05:36.26,main,State Security Service Officer A,0,0,0,,Just shut up already!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.65,0:05:39.41,main,Disguised Loid,0,0,0,,I heard there was a bomb in this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.41,0:05:41.67,main,Crew,0,0,0,,Oh... It's right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.10,0:05:44.02,main,Disguised Loid,0,0,0,,Pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.45,0:05:49.23,main,Disguised Loid,0,0,0,,I used to be in the navy. I was \Nin charge of disarming bombs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.23,0:05:51.02,main,Disguised Loid,0,0,0,,I'd like to offer my assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.33,0:05:55.37,main,Disguised Loid,0,0,0,,Is it possible to move \Nthis bomb away from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.37,0:05:58.87,main,State Security Service Officer A,0,0,0,,It's not. There's a trap in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.87,0:06:02.44,main,Disguised Loid,0,0,0,,A time bomb, type B-CP62.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.44,0:06:05.10,italics,Disguised Loid,0,0,0,,A bomb that extremists \Nfrom the West love using.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.10,0:06:07.12,italics,Disguised Loid,0,0,0,,Is the suspect someone \Nimportant from the East?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.12,0:06:08.84,italics,Disguised Loid,0,0,0,,Were they after this ship as a whole or...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.84,0:06:12.28,italics,Disguised Loid,0,0,0,,No, I haven't heard anything from \NHQ about a group like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.28,0:06:15.55,italics,Disguised Loid,0,0,0,,It's possible the bomb was designed\Nto look like the West was responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.55,0:06:17.12,main,State Security Service Officer A,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.12,0:06:18.56,main,State Security Service Officer A,0,0,0,,Think you can deal with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.13,0:06:22.88,main,Disguised Loid,0,0,0,,No problem at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.15,0:06:27.32,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I'm going to leave the bomb \Nto Papa and find Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.32,0:06:28.29,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.72,0:06:33.19,italics,Informant,0,0,0,,To think she pretty much slaughtered \Nall those well-known assassins.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.19,0:06:34.84,italics,Informant,0,0,0,,What a terrifying woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.34,0:06:36.94,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,A bad guy's voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.44,0:06:39.58,italics,Informant,0,0,0,,It's definitely time for me to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.58,0:06:42.72,italics,Informant,0,0,0,,I've made more than enough from this job.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.72,0:06:46.08,italics,Informant,0,0,0,,I'm getting the hell outta here \Nbefore those hyenas sniff me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.33,0:06:50.59,italics,Informant,0,0,0,,You guys can keep playing around \Nfor whatever time is left.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.82,0:06:52.59,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,The front of the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.59,0:06:56.11,italics,Informant,0,0,0,,Soon, this whole ship is \Ngonna sink into the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.11,0:06:59.30,italics,Informant,0,0,0,,Though no one will know what \Nhappened until it's far too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.11,0:07:02.18,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I lost the bad guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.18,0:07:04.89,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Well, whatever. Right now, \NI need to find Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.35,0:07:08.61,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,The roof toward the front! \NThe roof toward the front!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.83,0:07:18.61,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,That's... Mama's stabby thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.41,0:07:27.53,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.42,0:07:38.85,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I can't get close enough \Nto him to finish him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.06,0:07:44.25,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Mama's up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.25,0:07:46.39,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,She's having trouble because \Nshe's missing a weapon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.39,0:07:48.12,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,She's too far away to hear clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.12,0:07:50.66,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I need somewhere to climb up...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.23,0:07:52.10,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I can't find any!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.03,0:07:58.87,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya's gonna save Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.79,0:08:02.54,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Reach her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.54,0:08:07.55,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Rising Hope!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.29,0:08:21.75,main,Tank Top,0,0,0,,Hey! Stop making noise!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.75,0:08:24.51,main,Sunglasses,0,0,0,,It wasn't me. What the hell was that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.75,0:08:27.71,main,Tank Top,0,0,0,,If that demon woman finds \Nus, we're finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.71,0:08:31.27,main,Sunglasses,0,0,0,,I know that. Our only chance is right now \Nas she's struggling with the katana guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.58,0:08:34.97,main,Sunglasses,0,0,0,,This is our chance to take \Nout Gretcher, our target!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.12,0:08:38.82,main,Grey,0,0,0,,It's not going to be like this forever, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.78,0:08:42.78,main,Sunglasses,0,0,0,,Once we kill them, \Nwe're getting the hell outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.78,0:08:43.80,main,Sunglasses,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.15,0:09:01.00,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,All according to plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.59,0:09:05.08,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Gunshots from behind?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.26,0:09:08.44,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,That's my—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.04,0:09:26.01,main,Katana Guy,0,0,0,,Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.62,0:09:29.32,main,Katana Guy,0,0,0,,I'm going to end this with my next strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.35,0:09:42.05,italics,Glasses,0,0,0,,Look at her, charging like some idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.23,0:09:49.87,italics,Glasses,0,0,0,,You stupid old man...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.72,0:10:21.99,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,What happened to Mama's battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.40,0:10:27.03,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,It's finally over... I'm so tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.85,0:10:33.25,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Mama is victorious! It's all thanks to Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.25,0:10:35.67,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I need to let Olka and the others out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.94,0:10:45.07,main,State Security Service Officer C,0,0,0,,He successfully disarmed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.84,0:10:47.89,main,State Security Service Officer C,0,0,0,,Well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.39,0:10:48.78,main,State Security Service Officers,0,0,0,,Well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.78,0:10:49.91,main,Disguised Loid,0,0,0,,It was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.91,0:10:52.18,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm far more nervous about\Nbeing surrounded by so many
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.18,0:10:54.52,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,State Security Service \Nofficers than the bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.96,0:10:58.98,main,State Security Service Officer C,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.54,0:11:05.71,main,Informant,0,0,0,,Farewell, {\i1}Princess Lorelei{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.71,0:11:10.62,main,Informant,0,0,0,,Let me hear all the screams of \Nagony as you sink to your doom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.72,0:11:28.14,main,Yor,0,0,0,,But I wonder why my weapon was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.23,0:11:31.26,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Is there someone else around?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.26,0:11:34.66,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Oh, no! I must withdraw!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.99,0:11:41.36,main,Yor,0,0,0,,The wind must've blown it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.34,0:11:45.37,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Director! Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.01,0:11:51.27,main,State Security Service Officer A,0,0,0,,There are still multiple bombs?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.27,0:11:55.00,main,Disguised Loid,0,0,0,,If the suspect's goal is to sink this ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.00,0:11:57.90,main,Disguised Loid,0,0,0,,the amount of gunpowder here \Nis nowhere near enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.09,0:12:01.28,main,State Security Service Officer C,0,0,0,,Just in case, we should \Nevacuate the guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.28,0:12:02.49,main,State Security Service Officer B,0,0,0,,To where, exactly?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.49,0:12:05.24,main,State Security Service Officer B,0,0,0,,We don't even know how many bombs \Nthere are or where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.24,0:12:07.69,main,State Security Service Officer B,0,0,0,,Besides, the guest list is full \Nof tons of important people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.69,0:12:09.55,main,State Security Service Officer B,0,0,0,,We can't cause a commotion!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.77,0:12:11.70,italics,Disguised Loid,0,0,0,,Must be more State Security \NService officers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.70,0:12:14.21,main,State Security Service Officer B,0,0,0,,You know what'll happen if \Nyou blab any of this, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.78,0:12:18.21,main,State Security Service Officer B,0,0,0,,Have anyone who's free right now \Ncheck the rest of the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.21,0:12:19.19,main,State Security Service Officer B,0,0,0,,That goes for the crew, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.06,0:12:22.69,main,State Security Service Officer B,0,0,0,,Don't let the higher-ups figure \Nout what you're doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.05,0:12:33.34,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I need to hurry back or the lady from \Nthe kids' room is gonna yell at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.30,0:12:39.59,italics,Glasses,0,0,0,,Damn it. This hurts! \NI need to extract the bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.59,0:12:42.91,italics,Glasses,0,0,0,,I can't go with an orthodox \Nmethod... I need to regroup.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.91,0:12:45.22,italics,Glasses,0,0,0,,I'll kill them, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.78,0:12:50.16,main,Anya,0,0,0,,A bad guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.04,0:12:52.59,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,What'd you say, brat?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.89,0:12:57.84,italics,Glasses,0,0,0,,This scent is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.23,0:12:59.58,italics,Glasses,0,0,0,,Gunpowder?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.34,0:13:02.43,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,There's a bomb inside the clock?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.43,0:13:05.34,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,There are lots more than the \None Papa's looking for!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.64,0:13:07.77,italics,Glasses,0,0,0,,Could it be that bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.91,0:13:10.86,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,Tch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.14,0:13:15.04,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Oh, no! I need to let Papa know!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.04,0:13:17.66,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,But now I don't know where Papa is!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.66,0:13:21.26,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Actually, I can't tell him, 'cause then \Nhe'd find out about other stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.00,0:13:24.89,italics,Crew A,0,0,0,,This is bad... There are bombs on the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.89,0:13:27.78,italics,Crew A,0,0,0,,I know they told me to thoroughly \Nsearch the lower decks,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.78,0:13:29.07,italics,Crew A,0,0,0,,but where do I even start?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.07,0:13:30.30,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.96,0:13:33.66,main,Crew A,0,0,0,,Huh? What is it, little girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.02,0:13:37.30,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Earlier, some old guy I don't know stuck a...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.30,0:13:39.92,main,Anya,0,0,0,,stuck a boogie onto that clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.92,0:13:41.91,main,Anya,0,0,0,,That's real gross, so please clean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.91,0:13:46.50,main,Crew A,0,0,0,,A booger? Sorry, little girl, but I'm busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.50,0:13:47.49,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.96,0:13:51.93,italics,Crew A,0,0,0,,Wait... Getting information \Nabout some weirdo right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.93,0:13:55.68,italics,Crew A,0,0,0,,I mean, it's not very likely, \Nbut maybe it couldn't hurt to check...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.27,0:13:58.97,main,Crew A,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.00,0:14:01.69,italics,Guest,0,0,0,,Seriously...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.69,0:14:04.24,italics,Guest,0,0,0,,Those fireworks were amazing, weren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.24,0:14:06.59,italics,Guest,0,0,0,,Pardon me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.59,0:14:08.14,italics,Guest,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, we'll be on the island...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.51,0:14:11.94,italics,Informant,0,0,0,,Hm, they're coming in loud and clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.21,0:14:14.81,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Don't push yourself too much, Director.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.81,0:14:17.44,italics,Informant,0,0,0,,Looks like all the assassins \Nperished up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.36,0:14:26.33,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,Hey there, Mister Informant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.33,0:14:28.72,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're \Ngoing all by your lonesome?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.60,0:14:31.12,main,Informant,0,0,0,,So you're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.36,0:14:33.80,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,You're the one who planted \Nthe bombs, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.80,0:14:36.55,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,You were planning to take \Nall of us out with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.55,0:14:38.74,main,Informant,0,0,0,,Quit whining, you loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.74,0:14:42.88,main,Informant,0,0,0,,This is the perfect opportunity to send the \Ntargets and the Garden to a watery grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.88,0:14:46.85,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,I told you some of the client's \Nguests were on that ship, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.85,0:14:49.11,main,Informant,0,0,0,,Like any of them are that important.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.36,0:14:53.48,main,Informant,0,0,0,,Don't worry. The bombs are made to \Nlook like they were made in the West.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.48,0:14:58.75,main,Informant,0,0,0,,If things go well, war will break out again, \Nand weapon sales will be through the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.75,0:15:00.88,main,Informant,0,0,0,,The client will be plenty happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.88,0:15:02.31,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.31,0:15:04.55,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,Get this boat moving. I need to regroup.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.89,0:15:07.32,main,Informant,0,0,0,,Who the hell said I'd give you a ride?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.32,0:15:11.39,main,Informant,0,0,0,,There's only enough food \Nand water for one on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.66,0:15:15.65,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,In that case... it sounds \Nlike they belong to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.72,0:15:20.65,main,Crew B,0,0,0,,Bombs have been located \Nin the third cargo room,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.65,0:15:23.66,main,Crew B,0,0,0,,the upper part of the balance tank,\N and the boiler room.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.78,0:15:26.43,main,Disguised Loid,0,0,0,,Right... I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.15,0:15:29.01,main,Disguised Loid,0,0,0,,From what you're describing, it sounds like
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.01,0:15:31.50,main,Disguised Loid,0,0,0,,all the bombs were \Nplanted by the same person.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.50,0:15:35.09,main,Disguised Loid,0,0,0,,Please be careful of the trap\N I mentioned and proceed with caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.08,0:15:37.40,main,Disguised Loid,0,0,0,,Okay, on to the next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.40,0:15:38.74,main,Crew B,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.74,0:15:41.42,main,Crew B,0,0,0,,The upper floors... on the eighth deck, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.38,0:15:45.67,main,Crew B,0,0,0,,Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.16,0:15:47.89,italics,Disguised Loid,0,0,0,,With all these people around?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.89,0:15:50.28,italics,Disguised Loid,0,0,0,,Their goal isn't just to sink the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.28,0:15:52.89,main,Crew B,0,0,0,,We're just doing some \Nmaintenance on the clock here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.89,0:15:54.30,main,Disguised Loid,0,0,0,,We need to get these people away—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.84,0:15:58.44,italics,Disguised Loid,0,0,0,,No. There's probably no time for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.96,0:15:59.93,italics,Disguised Loid,0,0,0,,What should I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.93,0:16:01.72,main,Crew B,0,0,0,,We're just conducting some inspections!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.54,0:16:06.75,main,Crew B,0,0,0,,Uh, hello?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.75,0:16:08.89,main,Disguised Loid,0,0,0,,I'm going to go throw this into the ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.89,0:16:09.82,main,Crew B,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.33,0:16:19.07,main,Informant,0,0,0,,I'll let you in on a little \Nsecret before you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.07,0:16:22.57,main,Informant,0,0,0,,The second fireworks show is \Ngoing to begin any minute now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.57,0:16:26.03,main,Informant,0,0,0,,You'll be able to enjoy \Nthe symphony of agonized
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.03,0:16:29.34,main,Informant,0,0,0,,screams and roars coming through \Nthe wiretaps throughout the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.23,0:16:34.35,top,Crew B,0,0,0,,Hey! Wait! That clock is an antique!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.36,0:16:49.69,main,Disguised Loid,0,0,0,,Whew, that was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.69,0:16:51.36,main,Disguised Loid,0,0,0,,Hm? Was there something down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.66,0:16:53.38,main,Guest A,0,0,0,,What was that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.38,0:16:55.08,main,Guest B,0,0,0,,More fireworks?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.08,0:16:58.79,main,Disguised Loid,0,0,0,,Could you make some kind of \Nannouncement so there's no commotion?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.83,0:17:01.36,main,Crew B,0,0,0,,Understood...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.36,0:17:02.38,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.38,0:17:05.62,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,He stopped the bombs! All thanks to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.88,0:17:07.14,main,Lady,0,0,0,,I found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.14,0:17:08.97,main,Lady,0,0,0,,How dare you wander off like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.97,0:17:10.37,main,Anya,0,0,0,,L-Lady! Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.37,0:17:13.57,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I-It's because I was about \Nto poop my pants...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.57,0:17:16.48,main,Lady,0,0,0,,Then you should've just said so!\N We're heading back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.48,0:17:19.27,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Wait! There's still more bombs!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.27,0:17:22.02,main,Lady,0,0,0,,What? You haven't finished pooping yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.02,0:17:24.15,main,Lady,0,0,0,,Okay, then we're heading to the bathroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.74,0:17:28.69,main,Disguised Loid,0,0,0,,Thoroughly inspect each section, \Nincluding the upper floors.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.69,0:17:32.35,main,Disguised Loid,0,0,0,,It's possible there are still\Nterrorists on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.35,0:17:36.89,main,Disguised Loid,0,0,0,,Please request that the State Security \NService be on guard around the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.89,0:17:38.91,main,Crew B,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.41,0:17:48.15,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I thought I just heard some faint explosions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.15,0:17:51.93,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Some of them may still remain.\N Stay on your guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.25,0:17:54.53,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,All right. We're all set.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.53,0:17:56.67,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,It's a bit early, but let's lower the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.22,0:18:01.53,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Until the cruise ship gets far enough, \Nplease stay covered with this cloth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.53,0:18:02.42,main,Grey,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.83,0:18:04.43,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Please continue to take care of yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.22,0:18:15.68,main,Olka,0,0,0,,Thank you... so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.29,0:18:20.25,main,Yor,0,0,0,,U-Um... Your clothes will \Nget dirty! There's blood—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.09,0:18:24.70,main,Olka,0,0,0,,He wants a hug goodbye, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.05,0:18:29.47,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Really! My hands \Nare all sticky, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.59,0:18:35.01,main,Olka,0,0,0,,Your hands... are what \Nconnected him to his future.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.29,0:18:47.07,main,Yor,0,0,0,,He's... so warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.31,0:18:52.72,italics,Olka,0,0,0,,It might not be something \Nyou can wish for...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.31,0:18:56.80,italics,Olka,0,0,0,,I might be overstepping my \Nbounds... But even so...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.58,0:19:00.08,italics,Olka,0,0,0,,I pray that, someday, you and your family
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.08,0:19:03.76,italics,Olka,0,0,0,,will be able to find true peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.61,0:19:07.48,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,It looks like there are no problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.03,0:19:11.22,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Now we just have to wait for \Nword from the retrieval ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.22,0:19:14.11,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Do not let your guard down \Nuntil the dawn breaks—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.90,0:19:21.90,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Don't let yourself actually \Nbecome sentimental.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.00,0:19:27.70,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Don't forget that we are nothing \Nmore than foot soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.70,0:19:29.53,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I... I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.29,0:19:31.53,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,By the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.02,0:19:34.51,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,I forgot I had a message for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.51,0:19:37.46,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Forger is trying to set up somewhere \Nto meet with you tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.46,0:19:39.62,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,on the island we'll be staying at.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.49,0:19:42.02,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Loid and Miss Anya?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.30,0:19:43.54,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, but—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.54,0:19:45.90,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,I'll be on the lookout for any stragglers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.90,0:19:49.47,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,As a reward for completing this \Nmission, see their request through.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.71,0:19:56.91,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Make sure you ice your face so \Nthey don't see the swelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.46,0:19:58.31,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.61,0:20:00.97,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Make sure they don't see \Nthe wound on your chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.45,0:20:05.09,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I-I won't let them see it!\NI won't be wearing a swimsuit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.92,0:20:10.65,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I was somehow able to \Nensure everyone's safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.65,0:20:14.31,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm sure I can leave the rest \Nto the State Security Service.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.42,0:20:16.81,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm so late.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.67,0:20:23.39,main,Lady,0,0,0,,I guess she got tuckered out from waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.39,0:20:24.58,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.65,0:20:30.53,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I know it was an emergency, but I ended \Nup casting my family aside again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.06,0:20:33.83,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,What are you even saying, Twilight?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.38,0:20:36.44,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Your "family" is just another mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.96,0:20:40.31,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,But no... This time, \Nmy mission was this vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.31,0:20:43.85,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,No, wait, it's not a mission... uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.14,0:22:18.04,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,The bright crimson that \Nappears right before my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.75,0:22:27.94,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Stretches approximately 40,000 kilometers
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.06,0:22:35.79,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Our wounds that inch closer behind us
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.79,0:22:40.87,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Make us wander even more \Nwhen we're already lost
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.87,0:22:45.46,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,The unseeable, scentless, unmistakable future
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.46,0:22:47.39,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Stabbed me in the back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.39,0:22:48.55,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.55,0:22:58.09,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Let me stay by your side tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.09,0:23:05.81,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Just for tonight, I'm going to be serious
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.10,0:23:09.68,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Come closer to me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.68,0:23:11.97,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Even the future we prayed for
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.97,0:23:14.00,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Has a different path
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.00,0:23:17.54,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,My dear
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.09,0:23:21.60,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Our malice for each other
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.60,0:23:24.88,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Might just get to us
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.25,0:23:29.48,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Or maybe not
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.02,0:23:40.01,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(400,250)\fscx47}Enjoy the Resort to the Fullest\NBragging About Vacation
